WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
00:25.266 --> 00:27.852
You better be careful if you don't want your heart broken.

4
00:29.222 --> 00:30.187
Why?

5
00:30.622 --> 00:31.831
Is he really a red flag?

6
00:32.078 --> 00:34.789
All I know is he’s a walking heartbreak.

7
00:34.789 --> 00:37.000
There’s no chance of commitment with him.

8
00:37.876 --> 00:39.044
I should go.

9
00:39.377 --> 00:40.587
How will you get home?

10
00:40.920 --> 00:42.714
Come on, I'll take you home.

11
00:43.094 --> 00:44.096
It’s so early.

12
00:44.121 --> 00:46.290
Is this how you invite your FWBs?

13
00:46.843 --> 00:48.595
For the record, this is the first time.

14
00:48.595 --> 00:52.974
And you're the first girl I've ever invited to my condo in BGC.

15
00:53.224 --> 00:53.975
But okay,

16
00:53.975 --> 00:56.227
if you wanna come home to my place, I mean, I'm still down for that.

17
00:57.645 --> 00:58.772
It looks good on you.

18
00:59.647 --> 01:00.642
Do you have a crush on me?

19
01:12.261 --> 01:14.638
Meet me in Yesterday. 8PM, Wednesday.

20
01:14.996 --> 01:16.247
See you in Yesterday.

21
02:48.379 --> 02:49.421
Shan!

22
02:57.974 --> 02:58.933
Yes?

23
03:01.477 --> 03:02.896
How are your grades?

24
03:03.875 --> 03:06.628
I hope you get good grades, at least.

25
03:07.775 --> 03:09.611
Your tuition fee is so expensive.

26
03:10.570 --> 03:12.864
Did you really just ask me to come here for that?

27
03:14.157 --> 03:15.379
Why not?

28
03:15.992 --> 03:18.161
I’m the one paying for your tuition.

29
03:21.206 --> 03:22.540
Are you serious?

30
03:22.540 --> 03:24.457
Fine. If you want to see my grades, here.

31
03:28.129 --> 03:32.759
If you fail even once,

32
03:33.461 --> 03:35.922
you’ll be paying for your own tuition.

33
03:37.263 --> 03:39.098
I don’t want my money wasted.

34
03:40.308 --> 03:41.309
Are you broke?

35
03:43.228 --> 03:45.355
Is your business not doing well?

36
03:50.693 --> 03:52.904
It’s none of your fucking business.

37
03:59.369 --> 04:00.286
Why?

38
04:00.870 --> 04:02.830
Are you still expecting your shares?

39
04:03.915 --> 04:05.124
You won’t get anything anymore.

40
04:05.458 --> 04:07.919
Everything your mom gave you back then,

41
04:07.919 --> 04:08.419
that’s all you get.

42
04:08.753 --> 04:09.587
That’s it.

43
04:10.713 --> 04:12.298
Do you really want to talk about shares?

44
04:12.840 --> 04:14.259
Because if we’re talking about shares,

45
04:14.259 --> 04:16.511
I also have a right to the Ledezma group.

46
04:17.095 --> 04:18.054
And we both know,

47
04:18.054 --> 04:19.639
if it wasn’t because of mom,

48
04:20.175 --> 04:22.636
you wouldn’t be who you are now, right?

49
04:25.770 --> 04:26.980
Fuck you!

50
04:29.065 --> 04:30.817
I built this company myself.

51
04:31.276 --> 04:35.029
Your mom didn’t contribute anything except being a bitch.

52
04:36.656 --> 04:37.532
Get out!

53
04:41.786 --> 04:42.954
Fucking rude.

54
05:20.992 --> 05:22.118
Shan!

55
05:35.313 --> 05:36.397
What are you doing here?

56
05:36.507 --> 05:38.760
Hiro told us to check on you. Come here. What happened?

57
05:39.504 --> 05:40.922
It’s okay. I just had a fight.

58
05:41.126 --> 05:42.419
With your dad again?

59
05:44.474 --> 05:46.184
But don’t worry, I’m okay.

60
05:46.517 --> 05:47.643
Really, I’m okay.

61
05:47.727 --> 05:49.395
You know you can call us, right?

62
05:49.562 --> 05:50.313
Anytime.

63
05:50.742 --> 05:52.452
Yeah, I know. Thank you.

64
05:52.690 --> 05:54.859
But sorry, okay? I really need to leave.

65
05:57.612 --> 05:58.863
I’m just really late.

66
05:58.863 --> 05:59.739
Okay, I’ll—

67
05:59.947 --> 06:01.032
Wait. For what?

68
06:01.032 --> 06:03.034
I’ll message you. I’ll message you, guys. Okay?

69
06:03.680 --> 06:04.454
Please.

70
06:44.826 --> 06:45.618
Alex.

71
06:45.618 --> 06:46.035
Sir.

72
06:46.035 --> 06:48.204
Oh no, sir… What happened?

73
06:48.204 --> 06:49.497
Are you okay?

74
06:49.789 --> 06:50.915
Yeah, I’m okay.

75
06:51.666 --> 06:53.209
Did you see Kierra?

76
06:53.317 --> 06:55.819
Ms. Kierra? She already left.

77
06:56.358 --> 06:58.818
She was waiting over there for quite a while.

78
07:00.180 --> 07:02.501
Hold on, sir, I’ll get you an ice pack.

79
07:17.817 --> 07:19.318
Sorry, I was late.

80
07:19.928 --> 07:21.712
Should I just go near your place?

81
07:42.766 --> 07:44.454
I’m really sorry about earlier.

82
07:46.007 --> 07:49.861
Let me know, maybe we can try a cafe near your condo?

83
07:50.516 --> 07:51.851
Good morning, Kierra.

84
07:52.268 --> 07:53.644
Are you free later?

85
08:08.534 --> 08:09.775
Well, I guess that’s it.

86
09:18.312 --> 09:20.231
Can I try drawing, too?

87
09:22.483 --> 09:24.859
I dare you.

88
09:25.064 --> 09:26.941
Wow, you’re really good.

89
09:27.530 --> 09:29.907
Architecture really is your thing, huh?

90
09:30.700 --> 09:34.036
Come on, I’ve wanted it since I was little.

91
09:34.161 --> 09:35.079
Just like you.

92
09:36.027 --> 09:36.983
Yeah…

93
09:37.623 --> 09:39.333
But I’d rather be a painter.

94
09:41.794 --> 09:43.421
Why didn’t you take up painting then?

95
09:43.713 --> 09:46.841
I mean, you definitely got your dad’s talent.

96
09:48.801 --> 09:52.430
Architecture is the practical choice.

97
09:58.436 --> 09:59.617
- You know… - Hmm?

98
10:01.355 --> 10:03.024
You can still paint, you know.

99
10:03.357 --> 10:04.942
When you’re able to balance both.

100
10:05.074 --> 10:07.702
I mean, you don’t have to rush it.

101
10:07.727 --> 10:10.398
Besides, I think everything will fall into place.

102
10:12.533 --> 10:15.286
Wow. Where did you read that?

103
10:15.286 --> 10:16.287
Right?

104
10:16.287 --> 10:17.330
But yeah,

105
10:18.039 --> 10:20.593
when I have free time, I can still paint.

106
10:20.833 --> 10:21.667
Mhmm.

107
10:21.667 --> 10:24.837
And me, I’ll be your first fan, Ke.

108
10:24.837 --> 10:27.298
I can even pay the down payment for your painting now.

109
10:27.298 --> 10:28.257
Whatever!

110
10:28.752 --> 10:29.545
But fine.

111
10:30.509 --> 10:32.678
You’re treating me if we go out to drink this weekend.

112
10:33.054 --> 10:35.222
You’re such an idiot. We’re really drinking this weekend.

113
10:35.389 --> 10:36.682
It’s Sam’s birthday.

114
10:37.266 --> 10:40.269
I think she’s also introducing her boyfriend.

115
10:41.145 --> 10:43.689
She probably invited all her friends, didn’t she?

116
10:44.398 --> 10:47.026
Of course, everyone. You know Sam.

117
10:47.943 --> 10:50.446
Sam, do you know someone named Ciandrei?

118
10:50.780 --> 10:52.323
Well, he’s my friend but—

119
10:52.740 --> 10:55.409
You better be careful if you don't want your heart broken.

120
10:56.118 --> 10:58.746
I don’t think I’m available this weekend.

121
10:58.746 --> 10:59.747
Huh?

122
11:00.081 --> 11:01.248
That’s not allowed.

123
11:01.415 --> 11:04.251
We’re not allowed to not be there. We need to go.

124
11:04.752 --> 11:05.920
We all have to be there.

125
11:19.308 --> 11:21.727
Happy Birthday!

126
11:21.727 --> 11:22.186
Luna!

127
11:23.479 --> 11:26.649
Sevirous can’t make it, so it's just going to be Ke and Via.

128
11:26.649 --> 11:27.191
It’s okay.

129
11:27.191 --> 11:28.859
Happy birthday!

130
11:28.859 --> 11:29.819
Thank you.

131
11:29.819 --> 11:32.697
- Happy birthday! - Thank you, girls.

132
11:32.697 --> 11:33.948
Thank you for coming.

133
11:36.117 --> 11:37.785
Kalix is not here. Don’t worry.

134
11:39.745 --> 11:41.539
It’s not like I’m looking for him.

135
11:42.456 --> 11:46.210
Not looking ‘cause you don’t want to see him, or because you do want to?

136
11:46.210 --> 11:48.379
I said I’m not looking for him!

137
11:49.463 --> 11:51.132
So? Are you introducing someone to us?

138
11:51.590 --> 11:52.967
I wouldn’t want to waste my outfit.

139
11:52.967 --> 11:55.302
I love this song! Girls, let's dance!

140
11:55.302 --> 11:57.179
Come on! Hurry, let’s dance!

141
11:57.179 --> 11:57.722
Okay, fine!

142
11:57.722 --> 12:00.099
Come on, come on. We’ll get to that later.

143
12:03.310 --> 12:04.311
Happy Birthday!

144
12:04.311 --> 12:05.312
Thank you.

145
12:22.204 --> 12:23.122
Oh, yeah!

146
12:24.039 --> 12:24.832
Thank you.

147
12:29.253 --> 12:29.920
- [LUNA] Don’t leave me! - [SHAN] Wait!

148
12:29.920 --> 12:31.255
- [SAM] Hey. - [KIERRA] Sorry, Sam. I’m leaving.

149
12:31.505 --> 12:32.506
- [SAM] Huh? Why? - [SHAN] Wait!

150
12:32.506 --> 12:33.549
- [LUNA] Hey— - [SHAN] Sorry.

151
12:33.549 --> 12:35.342
[LUNA] Ke! Don’t leave me! Ke!

152
12:35.342 --> 12:36.927
What? What’s happening?

153
12:39.889 --> 12:40.556
Via?

154
12:40.556 --> 12:41.682
Larkin, what are you doing?

155
12:42.683 --> 12:43.368
What the—

156
12:44.268 --> 12:45.095
Hey!

157
12:45.853 --> 12:46.645
Wow.

158
12:47.354 --> 12:48.856
I’m so confused right now.

159
12:52.735 --> 12:53.555
Ke.

160
12:53.819 --> 12:54.445
Ke.

161
12:56.906 --> 12:58.032
Can we talk?

162
12:58.616 --> 13:01.786
I only came here hoping I could catch you.

163
13:02.828 --> 13:03.746
Wait, wait.

164
13:03.906 --> 13:04.991
- Hey! - Ke.

165
13:05.594 --> 13:07.513
Wait. Ke, do you know this guy?

166
13:07.958 --> 13:08.768
What’s wrong with you?

167
13:08.793 --> 13:10.836
Ke, go over there. I’ll handle this.

168
13:11.378 --> 13:13.172
Luna, you go first.

169
13:13.601 --> 13:14.853
We just need to talk.

170
13:14.924 --> 13:16.050
Do you know him?

171
13:17.760 --> 13:20.721
If you do anything to my cousin, I’ll find you, okay?

172
13:20.846 --> 13:22.848
So you better be careful, do you understand?

173
13:26.352 --> 13:27.228
Call me, okay?

174
13:27.228 --> 13:28.229
Mhmm.

175
13:36.612 --> 13:37.822
Are you mad at me?

176
13:38.447 --> 13:40.533
Why would I be mad at you? Did you do something?

177
13:43.160 --> 13:45.579
I’m sorry I was late the other day.

178
13:46.580 --> 13:48.916
I did go, but I missed you there.

179
13:49.959 --> 13:52.878
You’re not answering my calls and texts either.

180
13:53.921 --> 13:55.256
So why were you late?

181
14:00.511 --> 14:03.556
There was an emergency.

182
14:04.974 --> 14:06.225
Emergency.

183
14:06.684 --> 14:08.060
What kind of emergency?

184
14:11.313 --> 14:13.023
You know what, don’t even answer that.

185
14:13.065 --> 14:13.774
But Ke…

186
14:13.774 --> 14:14.441
No.

187
14:14.525 --> 14:15.818
It was my fault.

188
14:16.402 --> 14:18.654
Because I believed all those things you said.

189
14:19.697 --> 14:22.116
I almost forgot what kind of guy you are.

190
14:24.034 --> 14:25.411
What kind of guy am I?

191
14:26.537 --> 14:27.631
A lying jerk.

192
14:31.130 --> 14:33.132
You’re just playing with people.

193
14:33.919 --> 14:35.754
You have no respect.

194
14:37.464 --> 14:40.134
As long as it’s not your time being wasted, you’re fine with it.

195
14:42.094 --> 14:45.472
You like fucking around and disguising your acts as jokes.

196
14:48.267 --> 14:50.185
Right? That’s the kind of guy you are.

197
14:55.065 --> 14:56.275
That day.

198
14:57.693 --> 14:58.611
My Dad...

199
15:05.826 --> 15:06.702
Nevermind.

200
15:08.621 --> 15:09.914
Be careful going home.

201
15:11.624 --> 15:12.811
I’m sorry.

202
15:29.224 --> 15:32.139
When I was young, my dad said I should grow up like him

203
15:34.855 --> 15:37.460
so I could understand everything he does.

204
15:39.497 --> 15:41.772
Because if I grow up like my mom,

205
15:42.652 --> 15:44.936
he said I’d just be a lying, pathetic bitch like her.

206
15:48.077 --> 15:49.624
I don’t know who I take after.

207
15:51.830 --> 15:54.421
You are neither your dad nor your mom.

208
15:56.919 --> 15:58.929
You are you, Shan.

209
16:02.341 --> 16:05.260
What if I inherited all of their bad traits?

210
16:07.262 --> 16:12.977
Because now, I’m starting to hurt other people because of my problems.

211
16:13.417 --> 16:16.873
The same way they hurt me because of their own problems.

212
16:19.692 --> 16:21.835
Did something happen recently?

213
16:31.659 --> 16:33.061
I don’t like lying.

214
16:35.207 --> 16:38.061
But I guess it’s much easier that way than opening up.

215
16:39.461 --> 16:40.749
I understand.

216
16:42.328 --> 16:45.046
Being vulnerable sometimes is scary.

217
16:46.593 --> 16:50.180
But not being able to open up doesn’t make you a bad person.

218
16:50.973 --> 16:52.936
Why are you scared to open up?

219
16:56.603 --> 16:58.230
I don’t know, Doc.

220
17:00.232 --> 17:02.026
Maybe I’m scared.

221
17:03.902 --> 17:06.413
I’m scared that they’ll know the real me.

222
17:08.615 --> 17:10.874
What if they can’t accept who I am?

223
17:16.498 --> 17:18.679
I see a recurring pattern here.

224
17:20.836 --> 17:22.921
Your fear of being fully known.

225
17:23.505 --> 17:27.968
And because of this, you struggle to form close relationships.

226
17:30.095 --> 17:32.556
But this is something you can work on.

227
17:33.515 --> 17:35.893
The first step is to let those people in,

228
17:36.935 --> 17:38.701
even if it takes a while.

229
17:40.103 --> 17:42.614
This is the best way to build trust.

230
18:33.546 --> 18:34.464
So…

231
18:37.329 --> 18:39.706
Who was that guy the other night?

232
18:40.958 --> 18:43.043
You know that guy from Taft?

233
18:45.045 --> 18:45.796
No—

234
18:46.755 --> 18:48.007
Yeah, I just know him.

235
18:48.298 --> 18:50.384
Oh, you just know him, huh…

236
18:50.891 --> 18:53.269
Yeah. I’m just going to jog, okay?

237
18:53.294 --> 18:54.211
Okay.

238
18:56.020 --> 18:56.839
Wait!

239
18:58.649 --> 19:01.110
How did you know that he’s from Taft?

240
19:09.898 --> 19:10.831
Can I kiss you?

241
19:11.460 --> 19:12.252
Let’s kiss.

242
19:27.838 --> 19:31.563
Okay, I’ll tell you since it’s better you hear it from me than from him.

243
19:31.592 --> 19:32.426
What?

244
19:33.844 --> 19:36.805
This happened before… before Kalix, okay?

245
19:36.805 --> 19:38.932
- What I’m trying to say is... - What is it?

246
19:39.141 --> 19:41.226
I was drunk back then, and then...

247
19:41.226 --> 19:45.606
I kissed him because I was kind of trying to make Kalix jealous, and—

248
19:45.606 --> 19:47.316
I also didn’t know you’d meet each other—

249
19:47.316 --> 19:49.401
Ke, I’m so sorry, Ke.

250
19:49.401 --> 19:50.986
I’m really sorry! I didn’t really—

251
19:50.986 --> 19:54.448
Ke, I’m sorry, Ke. Don’t be mad.

252
19:54.823 --> 19:57.159
- Ke. - So, he kissed you?

253
19:58.035 --> 20:01.997
Wow, it seems like he’s really preyed on almost everyone, huh.

254
20:01.997 --> 20:03.540
I didn’t even know his name back then.

255
20:03.540 --> 20:05.792
And Ke, don’t fight over this, okay?

256
20:05.792 --> 20:06.919
Even though I know you two are already fighting.

257
20:06.919 --> 20:08.212
Are you mad?

258
20:08.962 --> 20:10.672
- Ke. - It doesn’t bother me, Luna.

259
20:10.672 --> 20:11.715
Really?

260
20:11.715 --> 20:13.217
Yeah, I’m just going to jog, okay.

261
20:13.634 --> 20:15.260
Ke, you’re mad, though.

262
20:15.260 --> 20:16.595
I’m just going to jog.

263
20:16.720 --> 20:17.429
Ke.

264
20:17.429 --> 20:19.640
It doesn’t bother me. It’s okay.

265
20:27.986 --> 20:29.654
No. I’m not going in.

266
20:29.733 --> 20:30.901
You’re not going in.

267
20:31.944 --> 20:32.743
Kierra.

268
20:32.942 --> 20:34.235
Roel, I’ll be quick.

269
20:35.489 --> 20:36.114
Hey.

270
20:37.047 --> 20:37.715
Elyse?

271
20:37.832 --> 20:39.041
Do you live around here?

272
20:39.451 --> 20:41.370
Yeah, I live nearby. What are you doing here?

273
20:41.578 --> 20:42.788
I’m just meeting someone.

274
20:44.206 --> 20:45.249
Okay, I’ll go ahead.

275
20:45.249 --> 20:46.416
Okay. Nice to see you.

276
20:46.625 --> 20:47.292
Alright.

277
20:58.679 --> 21:00.055
- Shan. - Ely.

278
21:07.020 --> 21:08.897
Why are you here? It’s still too early.

279
21:09.064 --> 21:12.734
Shan, you haven’t been answering your texts since you fought with Dad.

280
21:13.402 --> 21:14.111
Dad?

281
21:14.444 --> 21:15.279
Brother?

282
21:15.654 --> 21:16.738
Are they siblings?

283
21:20.284 --> 21:21.368
Can I look at it?

284
21:22.286 --> 21:23.787
Okay, it’s good.

285
21:23.812 --> 21:25.355
I can’t see the bruise anymore.

286
21:26.310 --> 21:27.478
Thank you, Ely.

287
21:27.624 --> 21:30.043
Thank you for checking up on me. I appreciate you.

288
21:30.711 --> 21:31.837
Of course.

289
21:32.129 --> 21:33.005
Bruise?

290
21:34.464 --> 21:35.382
What’s that?

291
21:36.729 --> 21:37.938
I just had a fight.

292
21:38.927 --> 21:40.345
Do you want another escape?

293
21:41.346 --> 21:42.514
Where are we going?

294
21:42.723 --> 21:45.892
Where I go when I want to be alone.

295
21:47.644 --> 21:48.645
So why were you late?

296
21:49.730 --> 21:52.816
There was an emergency.

297
21:57.571 --> 21:59.364
There really was an emergency.

298
22:08.665 --> 22:09.618
Take care, okay?

299
22:18.091 --> 22:22.929
Girl, can you order me an iced matcha latte? I’ll treat you!

300
22:37.569 --> 22:39.654
Good morning. What’s your order?

301
22:40.322 --> 22:42.991
We actually have a “buy one, take one” promo until this weekend.

302
22:43.450 --> 22:44.910
Oh, okay.

303
22:45.619 --> 22:49.498
One iced latte and one iced matcha latte.

304
22:49.998 --> 22:51.958
Iced latte and matcha latte—

305
22:54.252 --> 22:55.962
Do you want anything else?

306
23:02.427 --> 23:03.387
That’s all.

307
23:04.638 --> 23:05.514
Thanks.

308
23:08.767 --> 23:09.684
Two hundred fifty.

309
23:17.150 --> 23:18.485
Thank you.

310
23:20.237 --> 23:21.071
Here.

311
23:22.280 --> 23:24.366
I’ll just call your name when your order’s ready.

312
23:36.128 --> 23:37.254
Order for Kierra.

313
23:43.468 --> 23:44.594
Enjoy your day.

314
23:45.199 --> 23:46.200
You too.

315
24:04.197 --> 24:06.616
I’m sorry, come back.

316
24:14.791 --> 24:15.552
Ke!

317
24:17.002 --> 24:17.646
Yeah?

318
24:17.961 --> 24:19.629
You look like you just saw a ghost.

319
24:19.754 --> 24:20.357
Huh?

320
24:20.714 --> 24:21.465
Huh?

321
24:23.389 --> 24:24.098
Where are you going?

322
24:24.123 --> 24:25.332
I’m heading out for a bit.

323
24:25.357 --> 24:26.733
I’m sleeping at Mama’s place tonight.

324
24:28.305 --> 24:30.015
Don’t forget about our dinner, okay?

325
24:30.015 --> 24:31.141
Yeah.

326
24:31.141 --> 24:32.309
Okay, sure. Love you. Bye.

327
24:32.934 --> 24:33.661
Bye.

328
25:03.048 --> 25:03.896
Alex.

329
25:04.216 --> 25:05.383
Did she already come by—

330
25:05.383 --> 25:06.510
Ma’am Kierra?

331
25:07.138 --> 25:08.053
- Yeah. - She hasn’t yet.

332
25:08.053 --> 25:09.387
I haven’t seen her yet.

333
25:09.387 --> 25:11.306
But I’ll let you know if she stops by.

334
25:14.351 --> 25:15.352
Excuse me.

335
25:15.352 --> 25:16.353
What’s this?

336
25:16.353 --> 25:18.230
Can I also order one of those?

337
25:18.563 --> 25:20.690
Maybe we can order the barista, too.

338
25:23.318 --> 25:25.904
Sorry, but it’s not available.

339
25:26.196 --> 25:28.031
The drink or the one holding it?

340
25:30.992 --> 25:34.037
It’s the last day of our “buy one take one” promo. Do you want to avail of it?

341
25:34.895 --> 25:36.814
Alex, you take care of them, okay?

342
25:37.499 --> 25:39.626
Hi ma’am, so this is our best seller.

343
25:49.135 --> 25:50.595
Let’s have dinner tonight!

344
26:02.732 --> 26:03.775
Let’s get a dessert?

345
26:03.822 --> 26:04.656
Dessert?

346
26:08.266 --> 26:09.846
Well?

347
26:11.366 --> 26:14.744
Wow, she’s really into what she’s looking at. I know I’m pretty.

348
26:15.620 --> 26:16.329
It’s fine.

349
26:20.250 --> 26:21.835
His condo is close by.

350
26:22.385 --> 26:23.678
Huh? Who?

351
26:24.660 --> 26:25.995
Oh, Taft boy?

352
26:28.141 --> 26:31.227
Sorry, Ke. I didn’t know. I’m just really craving the food here.

353
26:32.387 --> 26:33.324
Are you two good now?

354
26:36.789 --> 26:38.958
Oh, I know that look.

355
26:39.644 --> 26:41.605
Why don’t you just talk to each other?

356
26:41.605 --> 26:44.107
If you two just talked, you wouldn’t be all up in your head right now.

357
26:44.292 --> 26:45.387
Common since.

358
26:45.657 --> 26:46.629
My god.

359
26:47.402 --> 26:48.737
Common sense.

360
26:49.070 --> 26:50.488
Common cents.

361
26:55.619 --> 26:57.120
What’s going on, bro?

362
26:58.580 --> 26:59.497
Nothing.

363
26:59.956 --> 27:00.749
Are you sure?

364
27:00.749 --> 27:01.652
Yeah.

365
27:03.126 --> 27:05.629
Wait, hold on. I’ll be right back.

366
27:05.629 --> 27:06.504
Where are you going?

367
27:07.672 --> 27:08.757
I just need to buy something.

368
27:09.174 --> 27:11.635
Cigarettes? You’re smoking again, man.

369
27:11.885 --> 27:12.719
I don’t smoke anymore.

370
27:12.719 --> 27:13.595
I’ll buy a froyo.

371
27:13.928 --> 27:14.721
Get me some, bro.

372
27:14.804 --> 27:15.764
I got you.

373
27:19.520 --> 27:20.354
Funny.

374
27:20.735 --> 27:22.362
We’re so near each other right now.

375
27:31.970 --> 27:33.388
Look outside.

376
27:41.755 --> 27:42.631
Luna.

377
27:43.333 --> 27:46.211
- I’m going to buy— - You’re meeting with Taft boy?

378
27:48.338 --> 27:50.548
Ke, come on, we’re like sisters.

379
27:51.341 --> 27:53.718
You can tell me everything, seriously.

380
27:54.803 --> 27:55.762
Okay.

381
27:56.304 --> 27:57.555
We’ll just talk for a bit.

382
27:57.806 --> 27:58.556
- Okay. - I’ll be right back.

383
27:58.556 --> 28:00.266
If you need backup, call me.

384
28:01.576 --> 28:02.369
Okay. I’ll be quick.

385
28:02.394 --> 28:03.269
Go.

386
28:15.073 --> 28:15.907
Hi.

387
28:18.993 --> 28:20.203
Let me make it up to you.

388
28:21.160 --> 28:24.538
Can we get coffee or go out or anything you want?

389
28:25.875 --> 28:28.044
Are you asking me out on a date again?

390
28:28.628 --> 28:30.380
Yes. A date.

391
28:30.405 --> 28:32.157
Then you’ll just ditch me again.

392
28:34.884 --> 28:36.845
I’m really sorry for what happened last time.

393
28:37.637 --> 28:39.013
I couldn’t show myself to you.

394
28:41.182 --> 28:43.810
After what happened, how can I trust you again?

395
28:46.765 --> 28:48.517
I know it’s not something that happens right away.

396
28:49.044 --> 28:53.590
I know, but can you give me a chance?

397
28:55.697 --> 28:58.684
Am I letting myself get played with again?

398
28:59.823 --> 29:01.492
I’m not playing with you.

399
29:03.353 --> 29:05.229
And I’ll never play you.

400
29:23.975 --> 29:24.809
How was it?

401
29:24.809 --> 29:25.852
So, are you two okay now?

402
29:27.266 --> 29:28.935
I said I’d think about it first.

403
29:30.899 --> 29:31.697
Right.

404
29:31.771 --> 29:34.273
You know, if he’s serious about you, he’ll wait for you.

405
29:34.861 --> 29:37.405
Right? Okay, come on. Let’s go.

406
29:46.289 --> 29:47.373
Thank you.

407
30:14.234 --> 30:16.277
Let’s have lunch here at home!

408
30:17.017 --> 30:18.436
Sorry, I can’t.

409
30:18.837 --> 30:19.796
Next time!

410
30:37.966 --> 30:38.967
Yo, what’s up?

411
30:38.992 --> 30:39.721
Bro,

412
30:40.343 --> 30:43.721
where the fuck are you? I’m only in Manila once in a while.

413
30:43.721 --> 30:46.808
Okay, okay. How about tomorrow? Let’s go out tomorrow.

414
30:46.894 --> 30:50.252
You’re still in the waiting room, huh?

415
30:52.719 --> 30:54.846
All right, guys, just enjoy yourselves, okay?

416
30:54.941 --> 30:56.317
Have fun. Take care.

417
30:56.985 --> 30:58.111
Bye.

418
31:18.949 --> 31:20.033
Hi, Kierra!

419
31:20.374 --> 31:22.710
Just wanted to ask if you’re free today?

420
31:23.036 --> 31:25.010
Or let me know when you’re available.

421
31:38.354 --> 31:39.522
What are you doing?

422
31:40.522 --> 31:41.635
Don’t rush her.

423
31:44.268 --> 31:46.019
She might not reply anyway.

424
32:08.045 --> 32:10.580
Hi, I’m free at 6 today.

425
32:12.414 --> 32:13.206
Okay.

426
32:13.389 --> 32:15.850
I’ll pick you up at 6! See you!

427
32:29.345 --> 32:31.263
You’re gonna trust him again?

428
32:33.361 --> 32:34.988
Don’t be such an idiot.

429
32:36.668 --> 32:37.455
Okay?

430
32:38.145 --> 32:39.605
One last chance.

431
32:43.257 --> 32:44.092
Ke.

432
32:44.404 --> 32:46.698
Oh. Where are you going?

433
32:47.637 --> 32:48.721
To BGC.

434
32:50.682 --> 32:51.705
You’re going to meet him?

435
32:54.185 --> 32:54.978
Okay.

436
32:55.668 --> 32:57.211
Are you sure you’re ready?

437
32:58.439 --> 32:59.408
Can you handle it?

438
32:59.983 --> 33:01.192
It’s just a distraction.

439
33:02.860 --> 33:03.611
Okay.

440
33:03.793 --> 33:05.545
Okay, then. Here you go.

441
33:07.490 --> 33:09.492
Just call me if you need anything.

442
33:10.243 --> 33:13.287
Just turn on your location on your phone, okay?

443
33:13.866 --> 33:15.284
I’ll let Sam know, too.

444
33:15.873 --> 33:16.557
Okay.

445
33:16.582 --> 33:17.317
Okay?

446
33:18.543 --> 33:19.335
Take care.

447
33:20.920 --> 33:21.796
Let’s just fix—

448
33:22.630 --> 33:23.881
Let’s fix this.

449
33:41.024 --> 33:41.816
Hi, Kierra.

450
33:42.650 --> 33:43.818
Hi. Have you been waiting long?

451
33:44.551 --> 33:45.969
No, I just got here.

452
33:46.484 --> 33:47.496
Where should we go?

453
33:47.572 --> 33:49.532
I prepared a few things to do tonight,

454
33:49.532 --> 33:51.826
but if you have something in mind, we can do that instead.

455
33:51.826 --> 33:53.119
No, let’s do your plan.

456
33:56.142 --> 33:57.145
You look nice.

457
33:58.825 --> 33:59.668
Is it okay?

458
34:00.313 --> 34:01.356
It suits you.

459
34:04.130 --> 34:05.590
You look nice, too.

460
34:07.675 --> 34:08.843
Let’s go.

461
34:16.491 --> 34:19.994
Sam, keep track of Ke, okay?

462
34:21.064 --> 34:26.949
I’ll call Via too, and let anyone who might be close know.

463
34:53.471 --> 34:54.430
Do you like your book?

464
34:55.014 --> 34:56.766
Yeah, I do. I got two.

465
34:57.642 --> 34:59.102
What are they about?

466
34:59.811 --> 35:04.357
One’s about architecture, and the other’s a rom-com.

467
35:05.108 --> 35:05.900
Nice.

468
35:05.900 --> 35:06.692
Yeah.

469
35:07.130 --> 35:08.590
- Here— - Sorry, Ke.

470
35:09.320 --> 35:11.739
I’m just going to the bathroom. I’ll be quick; I’ll be right back.

471
35:11.864 --> 35:12.490
Okay.

472
35:12.683 --> 35:13.350
Wait for me.

473
35:13.375 --> 35:13.959
Okay.

474
35:17.036 --> 35:17.745
Hey!

475
35:18.193 --> 35:19.069
Shan!

476
35:19.664 --> 35:20.331
Miguel.

477
35:21.833 --> 35:23.334
Nice seeing you here.

478
35:27.226 --> 35:29.407
Look at you. Dressed to impress, huh.

479
35:29.674 --> 35:30.967
Hot stuff!

480
35:32.301 --> 35:32.927
Who’s with you?

481
35:32.927 --> 35:33.678
Who are you with?

482
35:36.305 --> 35:37.172
Girlfriend?

483
35:37.974 --> 35:39.008
Is that your new girl?

484
35:39.892 --> 35:41.144
Introduce me, come on.

485
35:41.959 --> 35:45.838
I think you should introduce me to your new partner, don’t you think?

486
35:46.065 --> 35:46.941
It’s a bit rude.

487
35:49.853 --> 35:52.105
And I think she just left you.

488
36:07.003 --> 36:07.461
Ke.

489
36:07.461 --> 36:08.045
Why?

490
36:10.548 --> 36:11.549
Ke, where are you?

491
36:12.967 --> 36:14.719
Luna, help—

492
36:15.928 --> 36:17.680
Help me, Luna. I—

493
36:18.823 --> 36:20.408
Wait there, okay?

494
36:20.433 --> 36:21.642
Let me check your location.

495
36:22.643 --> 36:23.376
I don’t—

496
36:24.145 --> 36:25.521
I don’t know about this.

497
36:25.938 --> 36:27.440
Okay. I have your location now.

498
36:27.857 --> 36:29.066
Don’t go anywhere, okay?

499
36:29.066 --> 36:30.276
Sam’s on her way.

500
36:30.735 --> 36:33.362
Okay. Everything’s gonna be okay, Ke. Everything’s gonna be okay.

501
36:57.303 --> 36:57.887
Ke?

502
36:58.823 --> 37:00.575
Ke, it’s okay.

503
37:03.017 --> 37:03.851
It’s okay.

504
37:04.477 --> 37:06.479
It’s okay. I’m here, you're safe.

505
37:06.896 --> 37:08.522
Calm down. It's okay.

506
37:08.898 --> 37:09.732
Sam.

507
37:12.568 --> 37:13.444
You're safe.

508
37:14.805 --> 37:15.639
Sam.

509
37:49.021 --> 37:50.273
Did you find her?

510
37:51.464 --> 37:52.507
No, bro.

511
37:56.737 --> 37:58.364
She just vanished into thin air.

512
38:00.074 --> 38:02.159
Was I dating a ghost all along?

513
38:04.912 --> 38:08.874
If you weren’t dating, how could you say you love her?

514
38:10.918 --> 38:13.212
You need to be in the position to understand.

515
38:15.589 --> 38:17.675
I can’t put it into words.

516
38:21.375 --> 38:27.215
I didn’t even want to commit because I knew I'd eventually move to the US.

517
38:28.573 --> 38:35.497
But with Yanna, I took the risk even though I knew I’d get hurt.

518
38:46.716 --> 38:47.968
Why is it special?

519
38:49.679 --> 38:52.140
Because I only made it for you.

520
38:52.669 --> 38:54.319
You haven’t used it in a while, but you

521
38:54.343 --> 38:56.343
always keep an extra helmet ready for a girl?

522
38:56.841 --> 38:59.135
I haven't given any girl a ride on this yet.

523
38:59.542 --> 39:02.420
You know what, it’s actually my first time bringing someone here.

524
39:02.762 --> 39:04.305
You can't fool me.

525
39:04.972 --> 39:05.890
I’m telling the truth.

526
39:06.288 --> 39:08.290
Is this how you invite your FWBs?

527
39:08.734 --> 39:10.444
For the record, this is the first time.

528
39:10.469 --> 39:15.099
And you're the first girl I've ever invited to my condo in BGC.

529
39:16.382 --> 39:19.373
You know, it’s my first time sleeping over with

530
39:19.397 --> 39:22.388
a girl without ending up in the same bed as her.

531
39:26.160 --> 39:27.953
You? How’s that girl—

532
39:27.953 --> 39:29.512
uh… Kierra.

533
39:33.222 --> 39:38.853
I asked her out this Sunday, but I’m still waiting for her reply.

534
39:40.124 --> 39:42.293
Bro, it’s only Monday.

535
39:42.525 --> 39:44.443
Yeah, I know.

536
39:44.468 --> 39:47.346
But who knows, she might text. I need to confirm right away.

537
39:48.974 --> 39:50.083
You’re one to talk, though.

538
39:50.218 --> 39:52.262
You’ve been waiting for Yanna for so long.

539
39:59.977 --> 40:02.004
I guess we’re both inside the waiting room, huh?

540
40:08.911 --> 40:09.880
Willing to wait.

541
40:11.497 --> 40:13.207
I’m willing to wait for her, too.

542
40:28.722 --> 40:31.600
Hi, I’m free at 6 today.

543
40:32.601 --> 40:36.063
Okay. I’ll pick you up at 6! See you!

544
41:28.703 --> 41:29.833
You look nice.

545
41:31.965 --> 41:32.841
Is it okay?

546
41:33.489 --> 41:34.657
It suits you.

547
41:37.291 --> 41:38.848
Your outfit suits you, too.

548
41:48.158 --> 41:49.701
Sam, this is so hard.

549
41:50.471 --> 41:52.389
This is just so hard.

550
41:53.766 --> 41:56.060
Eat something first. Do you still have a fever?

551
41:56.550 --> 41:57.926
Why don’t you guys go out for a bit?

552
41:58.020 --> 41:59.438
- She said you guys should go out. - Just go out.

553
41:59.438 --> 42:00.262
Are you hungry?

554
42:00.593 --> 42:02.052
Let me stay here with you for now.

555
42:10.339 --> 42:14.135
So, you’re dreaming of the same scenario?

556
42:21.877 --> 42:23.337
Lopez.

557
42:24.880 --> 42:26.317
I’ve been nice to you, right?

558
42:27.007 --> 42:28.300
Be nice to me.

559
42:32.896 --> 42:34.398
Why are you alone?

560
42:36.128 --> 42:37.046
Don’t you have a date?

561
42:37.405 --> 42:38.323
A date?

562
42:39.353 --> 42:40.354
Poor you.

563
42:40.354 --> 42:43.065
Fine, I’ll be your date tonight.

564
42:43.065 --> 42:44.065
MkvDrama.net
